        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/6e33094fcb1c4a1d6a3bcba3c043afc4.avif?t=1763121616\" width=609 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a text‑based game where choices drive the narrative. You play as “me,” and your decisions will determine my fate—and the fate of the entire game (world).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/4a006e19bbf36276feed5826a31e2a30.avif?t=1763121616\" width=609 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Multiple Endings]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember: there is only ONE main route!!! Your choices will influence “my” thoughts and can ultimately trigger a BAD END.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Wild Imagination]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The script is adapted from one of two short stories I wrote in middle school. The writing might be a bit rough, but I promise the imagination will surprise you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/8eaec512431a1848626eaba46c462802.avif?t=1763121616\" width=609 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/2a7173b319db276e28e211f9b3acfe74.avif?t=1763121616\" width=699 height=343 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/2af8ce28ec244780c04e168a00af4dc2.avif?t=1763121616\" width=699 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/dc73bbe7bbb0d5e7f758a4218a0db6b8.avif?t=1763121616\" width=609 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All people and events in this story exist in a virtual space and have no relation to the real world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/0af7f9d7377ec4107cf5328172954650.avif?t=1763121616\" width=609 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I’m Shifeifan, an indie game developer from China. You’re welcome to follow my Bilibili account “正常的一个人.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can also add my WeChat for conversation, or send bug reports and suggestions to my email—many thanks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WeChat: blackbird_3</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Email: QQ: 3362669785</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/6e33094fcb1c4a1d6a3bcba3c043afc4.avif?t=1763121616\" width=609 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a text‑based game where choices drive the narrative. You play as “me,” and your decisions will determine my fate—and the fate of the entire game (world).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/4a006e19bbf36276feed5826a31e2a30.avif?t=1763121616\" width=609 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Multiple Endings]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember: there is only ONE main route!!! Your choices will influence “my” thoughts and can ultimately trigger a BAD END.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Wild Imagination]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The script is adapted from one of two short stories I wrote in middle school. The writing might be a bit rough, but I promise the imagination will surprise you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/8eaec512431a1848626eaba46c462802.avif?t=1763121616\" width=609 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/2a7173b319db276e28e211f9b3acfe74.avif?t=1763121616\" width=699 height=343 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/2af8ce28ec244780c04e168a00af